0..71 Comment "// A model passed to an implicit: a function quantifies over a model in"
72..144 Comment "// its prefix block, `[s : Model(Tally)]`, which binds one parameter per"
145..223 Comment "// component of `Tally`, and reads each as `s.x`. A call supplies a module for"
224..303 Comment "// it by name, `stepped[.s = Up](4)`, passing the module\'s members; a module of"
304..382 Comment "// a theory that includes `Tally` passes its reduct, and a function passes its"
383..463 Comment "// own model implicit on, `stepped[.s = t]`. A manifest model type fixes a sort,"
464..492 Comment "// which binds no parameter."
493..495 Comment "//"
496..510 Comment "// - see: #739"
